  "review_notes": [
    "Two added units. The ASV marks only *the Levites* as supplied, but the *of* at t004 exists solely to attach that supply to *the rest*, so it joins the added unit rather than being handed to הַנּוֹתָרִים. The competing reading keeps *rest of* together and marks only t005–t006 added; I took the wider unit because *rest of* with no rectum is not a rendering of anything."
